      "final_reason": "The no-sulfur 1000X Mixes block positively substitutes magnesium chloride hexahydrate 28.9, ferrous chloride tetrahydrate 0.698, zinc chloride 1.095, manganese chloride tetrahydrate 0.154 and copper chloride dihydrate 0.0392 g/L for the sulfate inputs. It retains NTA 20, calcium chloride dihydrate 6.67, ammonium molybdate tetrahydrate 0.0185, EDTA 0.25, cobalt nitrate hexahydrate 0.025 and borax 0.0177 g/L. The whole owner retains these literal masses rather than converting them to equimolar substitutes. Borax structure is independently witnessed.",
