      "complete_row_recommendation": "CONDITIONAL_SUPPORT_SCOPED_COMPLETE_ROW",
      "final_reason": "The authentic existing UNMAPPED0519 lineage is retained in this owner. JCM431, NBRC1257 and NBRC1321 each give NaOH 0.4 g, Na2SeO3·5H2O 6 mg, Na2WO4·2H2O 8 mg and 1 L distilled water. NBRC autoclaves the stock while JCM adds it before basal-medium autoclaving; the shared nominal recipe does not erase those procedures. Inspected ChEBI captures support sodium hydroxide, selenite pentahydrate and tungstate dihydrate references. All original histories and raw source spellings survive.",
